{
  "name": "Find and verify work emails for a lead list with looot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Find and verify work emails with looot\n\nReads a lead list from Google Sheets, finds a work email for each person, verifies it, and writes the result back to the same row. One lead at a time, 1 second apart.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a token at https://looot.ai (sign up, open the dashboard, create an API token) and add prepaid balance (top up from $5). There is no subscription.\n2. In n8n create a **Header Auth** credential named `looot API token`. Name: `Authorization`. Value: `Bearer <your token>`. Select it on both HTTP Request nodes.\n3. Connect a Google Sheets credential. In **Get Leads** and **Save Result** pick your spreadsheet and sheet.\n4. The sheet needs the columns `first_name`, `last_name`, `domain` (input) and `email`, `verification_status`, `cost_usd` (output, empty to start).\n5. Run it with a few rows first.\n\n### What it costs\nPrices from the public catalog on 2026-10-08, cheapest provider per call (`GET https://api.looot.ai/v1/catalog/overview?depth=jobs`):\n- `job:people.email.find`: $0.003598 per call, $0.019 per email found\n- `job:people.email.verify`: $0.00145 per call\n\nlooot picks the provider, so the price you pay depends on who answers. The exact charge of each call is written to `cost_usd` (the `actualCost` field of the run). Failed calls are not charged. A lead with no email found is a normal result and goes into the sheet as `not_found`.\n\n### Field paths this template assumes\n- Both calls: `status` (`completed`, `failed`, ...) and `actualCost`.\n- Email: `normalized.fields.email`, else `result.email`, `result.data.email`, `result.items[0].results.emails[0].email`.\n- Verification: `normalized.fields.status` (`valid`, `invalid`, `catch_all`, `risky`, `unknown`), else `result.status`, `result.data.status`.\nThe raw `result` is the provider's own body and differs by provider. If your rows come back with an empty `email` although the run completed, open the run output and add the right path to the email expression. It appears in the nodes **Email Found?**, **Verify Email** and **Build Verified Row**.\n\n### Notes\n- `job:` ids let looot choose the provider. To pin one provider, replace the id with an endpoint id from https://api.looot.ai/v1/public-catalog.\n- The idempotency key is `<execution id>-find-<sheet row>`. Running the workflow again starts a new execution and is charged again.\n- `?wait=30` makes looot hold the request up to 30 seconds for the answer. Raise the Wait node for larger lists if you hit rate limits.\n- Docs: https://docs.looot.ai",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Leads"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Get Leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Loop Over Leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.looot.ai/v1/runs?wait=30",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ endpointId: 'job:people.email.find', input: { first_name: $json.first_name, last_name: $json.last_name, domain: $json.domain }, idempotencyKey: $execution.id + '-find-' + $json.row_number }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 70000
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Find Work Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        740,
        320
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "looot API token"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.normalized?.fields?.email || $json.result?.email || $json.result?.data?.email || $json.result?.items?.[0]?.results?.emails?.[0]?.email || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Email Found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.looot.ai/v1/runs?wait=30",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ endpointId: 'job:people.email.verify', input: { email: $json.normalized?.fields?.email || $json.result?.email || $json.result?.data?.email || $json.result?.items?.[0]?.results?.emails?.[0]?.email || '' }, idempotencyKey: $execution.id + '-verify-' + $('Loop Over Leads').item.json.row_number }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 70000
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Verify Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1220,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "looot API token"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "row_number",
              "value": "={{ $('Loop Over Leads').item.json.row_number }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $('Find Work Email').item.json.normalized?.fields?.email || $('Find Work Email').item.json.result?.email || $('Find Work Email').item.json.result?.data?.email || $('Find Work Email').item.json.result?.items?.[0]?.results?.emails?.[0]?.email || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "verification_status",
              "value": "={{ $json.status === 'completed' ? ($json.normalized?.fields?.status || $json.result?.status || $json.result?.data?.status || $json.result?.result || 'unknown') : 'verify_' + ($json.status || 'error') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
              "name": "cost_usd",
              "value": "={{ Number($('Find Work Email').item.json.actualCost || 0) + Number($json.actualCost || 0) }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Build Verified Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1460,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
